{"id":281,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It resembles a maiden in appearance, but it wields strange powers to project visions of paradise. I suspect the crimson ornaments on its head are the key to its abilities."},{"games":["Shield","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future."},{"games":["Sword","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Kirlia uses the horns on its head to amplify its psychokinetic power. When the Pokémon uses its power, the air around it becomes distorted, creating mirages of nonexistent scenery."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"It is said that a Kirlia that is exposed to the positive emotions of its Trainer grows beautiful. This Pokémon controls psychokinetic powers with its highly developed brain."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"The cheerful spirit of its Trainer gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A KIRLIA has the psychic power to create a rip in the dimensions and see into the future. It is said to dance with pleasure on sunny mornings."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Trace","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon copies an opposing Pokémon's Ability."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like","Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate"